          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. A light ray is incident on a mirror and gets reflected by it (Fig. 10.21). The angle made by the incident ray with the normal to the mirror is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . What is the angle made by the reflected ray with the mirror? (i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 5 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iv) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.229,
            0.882,
            0.267
          ],
          "content": [
